sequenceDiagram
participant A0 as Scenario
participant A1 as Repository
participant A2 as Poll
participant A3 as Factory
participant A4 as Context
A0->>A1: WaitForAsync(predicate, timeout)
A1->>A2: repeat observation until matching row
A2->>A3: create context for each observation
A3->>A4: new EF context
A2->>A4: AsNoTracking + predicate + FirstOrDefaultAsync
A4-->>A2: detached row or null; dispose context
A2->>A2: no row -> cancellable delay -> fresh context
A2-->>A0: matching row or timeout/cancellation
